 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "Welcome back, everyone.",
   "start": 7.35,
   "end": 14.5
  },
  {
   "text": "For those who haven't met me yet.",
   "start": 7.35,
   "end": 14.5
  },
  {
   "text": "My name is Ksenia Se.",
   "start": 14.5,
   "end": 19.85
  },
  {
   "text": "I'm writing to Turing Post, and where we explain AI research.",
   "start": 14.5,
   "end": 19.85
  },
  {
   "text": "And what it means for people to implement it in their business.",
   "start": 19.85,
   "end": 23.3
  },
  {
   "text": "So, how's the conference treating you so far?",
   "start": 23.3,
   "end": 26.7
  },
  {
   "text": "Oh, that's good.",
   "start": 26.7,
   "end": 34.05
  },
  {
   "text": "Yeah, you guys.",
   "start": 26.7,
   "end": 34.05
  },
  {
   "text": "Thank you. I I'm sure the team appreciates.",
   "start": 26.7,
   "end": 34.05
  },
  {
   "text": "That you applause to them.",
   "start": 34.05,
   "end": 39.95
  },
  {
   "text": "So let's. Let's make some.",
   "start": 34.05,
   "end": 42.5
  },
  {
   "text": "More noise, because it's the last leg of our journey, and we have one more block of panels together.",
   "start": 42.5,
   "end": 49.35
  },
  {
   "text": "Let's appreciate the previous speakers and the new speakers that will come out soon.",
   "start": 49.35,
   "end": 54.15
  },
  {
   "text": "And before we dive in, let's take a moment to thank.",
   "start": 60.15,
   "end": 63.2
  },
  {
   "text": "The amazing people, the companies who supported AI engineer.",
   "start": 63.2,
   "end": 69.2
  },
  {
   "text": "We are going to do a lot of more applause today.",
   "start": 63.2,
   "end": 69.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Thanks to them, we're able to hear so many insightful talks.",
   "start": 69.2,
   "end": 74.25
  },
  {
   "text": "Meet so many incredible people and.",
   "start": 74.25,
   "end": 77.35
  },
  {
   "text": "They might become your friends, your colleagues, your partners.",
   "start": 77.35,
   "end": 84.8
  },
  {
   "text": "That's what I love about this conference.",
   "start": 77.35,
   "end": 84.8
  },
  {
   "text": "Always, very meaningful connections.",
   "start": 77.35,
   "end": 84.8
  },
  {
   "text": "So, this is our presenting sponsor, Arize.",
   "start": 84.8,
   "end": 89.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Please thank them.",
   "start": 89.1,
   "end": 92.35
  },
  {
   "text": "They amazing, and they made it possible.",
   "start": 89.1,
   "end": 92.35
  },
  {
   "text": "Um, our. Personal sponsors Oracle.",
   "start": 92.35,
   "end": 102.25
  },
  {
   "text": "This is our gold sponsors, a huge.",
   "start": 107.35,
   "end": 111.45
  },
  {
   "text": "A lot of beautiful, wonderful companies that we're very thankful for, and that we have super sponsor sponsors.",
   "start": 111.45,
   "end": 118.5
  },
  {
   "text": "Also, also a lot of applause to them.",
   "start": 118.5,
   "end": 125.3
  },
  {
   "text": "Thank you, thank you, thank you, and then basically.",
   "start": 118.5,
   "end": 125.3
  },
  {
   "text": "All of us and the supporting partners and every company and every speaker who made it possible.",
   "start": 125.3,
   "end": 132.7
  },
  {
   "text": "Thank you. Thank you.",
   "start": 125.3,
   "end": 132.7
  },
  {
   "text": "Thank you. Now, a couple of words.",
   "start": 125.3,
   "end": 137.25
  },
  {
   "text": "How my day went.",
   "start": 132.7,
   "end": 137.25
  },
  {
   "text": "I spend the day talking to other speakers and participants.",
   "start": 137.25,
   "end": 141.4
  },
  {
   "text": "And what I've noticed is that one of the strongest incentives to come to this conference is hiring.",
   "start": 141.4,
   "end": 148.45
  },
  {
   "text": "To the point that even some speakers.",
   "start": 148.45,
   "end": 152.85
  },
  {
   "text": "Are hiring and also looking for work.",
   "start": 152.85,
   "end": 155.9
  },
  {
   "text": "So, I have a little idea for you about how to benefit the most.",
   "start": 155.9,
   "end": 163
  },
  {
   "text": "From this amazing conference, and make sure the financial part gets some thoughtful attention too.",
   "start": 163,
   "end": 169.75
  },
  {
   "text": "So I suggest you build an agent.",
   "start": 169.75,
   "end": 173.45
  },
  {
   "text": "That takes the conference program and makes a list of all the speakers and their companies.",
   "start": 173.45,
   "end": 179.7
  },
  {
   "text": "Then you rank them yourself based on whose work and talk you found the most interesting.",
   "start": 179.7,
   "end": 185.4
  },
  {
   "text": "And who you would actually like to work with?",
   "start": 185.4,
   "end": 188.5
  },
  {
   "text": "The next step is to send your agent to those companies' careers pages, right?",
   "start": 188.5,
   "end": 193.35
  },
  {
   "text": "And find them open positions to match them to your experience, and collect the published.",
   "start": 193.35,
   "end": 199.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Compensation ranges. Then look at your ranking again.",
   "start": 199.2,
   "end": 204.8
  },
  {
   "text": "And if the salary changes your mind and changes your ranking.",
   "start": 204.8,
   "end": 208.6
  },
  {
   "text": "That's fine. You are updating your beliefs based on the evidence.",
   "start": 208.6,
   "end": 214.3
  },
  {
   "text": "So. Now, while you still here, I encourage you to go and find the people you would really like to.",
   "start": 208.6,
   "end": 220.45
  },
  {
   "text": "Work with or meet and talk to them.",
   "start": 220.45,
   "end": 223.35
  },
  {
   "text": "Because you've heard their talks and you know something about their work, and that would be just such a good conversation starter.",
   "start": 223.35,
   "end": 230.8
  },
  {
   "text": "And please don't make your agents send out your resume automatically.",
   "start": 230.8,
   "end": 238.15
  },
  {
   "text": "That's basically that carbonell.",
   "start": 238.15,
   "end": 242
  },
  {
   "text": "Um. So. This is the project for you for the rest of the day or the trip home.",
   "start": 238.15,
   "end": 248.95
  },
  {
   "text": "Now let's hear how AI is being put to work at Apple.",
   "start": 248.95,
   "end": 254.05
  },
  {
   "text": "Please help me welcome Michael Manapat.",
   "start": 254.05,
   "end": 257.35
  },
  {
   "text": "Co-founder of Rowspace and Jack McDonald, principal at Apollo Global Management, and CEO of Rating Reach.",
   "start": 257.35,
   "end": 264.7
  },
  {
   "text": "For AI advances, an inside look at Apollo's approach.",
   "start": 264.7,
   "end": 269.1
  }
 ],
